  "title": "Kristen's Awesome Oatmeal Cookies",
  "description": "This is my mothers recipe and it really is awesome! They are somewhat crispy but not cakey. You can add raisins, chocolate chips or coconut to this recipe too.",
  "authors": [
    "Kristen Hathaway"
  ],
